gantt
    title Software Preparation Disciplines - Optimal Timeline
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat  %b %d
    excludes    weekends

    section Phase 1 - Vision
    Market Research              :p1a, 2026-01-05, 5d
    Stakeholder Identification   :p1b, 2026-01-05, 5d
    Business Case Development    :p1c, after p1b, 7d
    Product Strategy             :p1d, after p1c, 5d
    GATE Go No-Go                :milestone, m1, after p1d, 0d

    section Phase 2 - Exploration
    Ideation                     :p2a, after m1, 7d
    User Research                :p2b, after m1, 7d
    Feasibility Study            :p2c, after p2a, 5d
    Compliance Analysis          :p2d, after p2a, 5d
    Risk Management              :p2e, after p2c, 3d
    Proof of Concept             :p2f, after p2e, 7d
    GATE Validated Concept       :milestone, m2, after p2f, 0d

    section Phase 3 - Requirements
    Persona Development          :p3a, after m2, 5d
    Business Requirements        :p3b, after m2, 5d
    User Journey Mapping         :p3c, after p3a, 5d
    Functional Specification     :p3d, after p3c, 7d
    Non-Functional Requirements  :p3e, after p3c, 5d
    User Story Writing           :p3f, after p3d, 5d
    Requirements Prioritization  :p3g, after p3f, 3d
    Requirements Traceability    :p3h, after p3g, 2d
    GATE Approved Requirements   :milestone, m3, after p3h, 0d

    section Phase 5a - Architecture early
    Solution Architecture        :p5a, after p3b, 7d
    Security Architecture        :p5b, after p5a, 5d
    Data Architecture            :p5c, after p5a, 5d
    Infrastructure Design        :p5d, after p5a, 5d

    section Phase 4 - Experience Design
    Information Architecture     :p4a, after p3d, 5d
    Interaction Design           :p4b, after p4a, 5d
    Accessibility Design         :p4c, after p4a, 5d
    Visual UI Design             :p4d, after p4b, 5d
    Prototyping                  :p4e, after p4d, 5d
    Usability Testing            :p4f, after p4e, 5d
    GATE Validated Designs       :milestone, m4, after p4f, 0d

    section Phase 5b - Architecture late
    Integration Design           :p5e, after p5b, 5d
    Technical Specification      :p5f, after p5e, 7d
    GATE Technical Blueprint     :milestone, m5, after p5f, 0d

    section Phase 6 - Planning
    Scope Definition WBS         :p6a, after m3, 5d
    Legal Review                 :p6b, after m3, 5d
    Definition of Done           :p6c, after m3, 3d
    Estimation and Planning      :p6d, after p6a, 5d
    Vendor and Procurement       :p6e, after p6a, 5d
    QA Planning                  :p6f, after p6a, 5d
    Resource and Team Planning   :p6g, after p6d, 3d
    Documentation Strategy       :p6h, after p6f, 3d
    Change Management Planning   :p6i, after p6g, 3d
    Stakeholder Comms Planning   :p6j, after p6g, 3d
    GATE Ready to Build          :milestone, m6, after p6i, 0d
